=== gc-P1a (rejection): LEFT JOIN on the partial-key CTE join ===
Partial CTE lookup key not supported.  The virtual CTE primary key matches the CTE body's GROUP BY column list and the join must bind every key column.  Workaround: place the multi-key CTE on the joined root and join the smaller table to it (an INNER join from the root parent is rewritten that way automatically).
Error handling: RPE
ronsql_cli caught exception: Partial CTE lookup key not supported.

=== gc-P1b (rejection): partial-key CTE keyed off a non-root alias ===
Partial CTE lookup key not supported.  The virtual CTE primary key matches the CTE body's GROUP BY column list and the join must bind every key column.  Workaround: place the multi-key CTE on the joined root and join the smaller table to it (an INNER join from the root parent is rewritten that way automatically).
Error handling: RPE
ronsql_cli caught exception: Partial CTE lookup key not supported.

=== gc-P1c (rejection): full-count key on a non-GROUP-BY column ===
CTE lookup key references a CTE output column that is not part of the virtual primary key.  The virtual CTE primary key matches the CTE body's GROUP BY column list.
Error handling: RPE
ronsql_cli caught exception: CTE lookup key references a non-key CTE column.

=== gc-P2b (rejection): key sources on unrelated sibling branches ===
ON conditions reference tables from unrelated join branches. Multi-table ON conditions are supported only when the referenced tables lie on a single ancestor chain.
Error handling: RPE
ronsql_cli caught exception: ON parents not on one ancestor chain.

=== gc-P3 (rejection): non-aggregating CTE body ===
CTE lookup key references a CTE output column that is not part of the virtual primary key.  The virtual CTE primary key matches the CTE body's GROUP BY column list.
Error handling: RPE
ronsql_cli caught exception: CTE lookup key references a non-key CTE column.
